## Objections to component-level position

Main blockers to contest downstream:

- Don’t render footer as last `LazyColumn` item if pinned bottom remains required.
- Don’t reuse `DrawerFooter` — it is interactive and tied to About/dev-mode behavior.
- Don’t read app `BuildConfig` from library modules.
- Don’t add Component/ViewModel/use case/Koin/repository for this static UI text.
